言絕句","heading_level":null,"series":null,"lines":["羅巾書滿歲寒詞，","小字紅鈐付所知。","冰雪心腸冰雪貌，","年年相對插梅時。"],"prose":"","notes":[{"position":{"field":"lines","line":1,"offset":2},"text":"蘇軾詩：羅巾別淚空熒熒。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":2,"offset":2},"text":"李賀詩：越王嬌郎小字書。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":3,"offset":4},"text":"蘇軾詩：使我冰雪腸，不受麴蘖醺。江總詩：淨心抱冰雪。朱子梅詩：姑射仙人冰雪容。"}],"source_pages":[101],"confidence":0.88,"boundary_state":"closed","continues_previous":false},{"kind":"poem","title":"從改第八首","subtitle":"","author":"","form":"七言絕句","heading_level":null,"series":null,"lines":["玉膩綿香細骨軀，","暖相偎處恰愁吁。","嬌癡怕對春風換，","不似寒宵酷念奴。"],"prose":"","notes":[{"position":{"field":"lines","line":1,"offset":7},"text":"《拾遺記》石崇妓相戲曰：爾非細骨輕軀，那得百琲真珠。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":2,"offset":7},"text":"杜甫《雕賦》：頗愁吁而蹭蹬。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":3,"offset":2},"text":"張以甯詩：小姑十三方嬌癡。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":4,"offset":7},"text":"猗覺寮雜記：男曰奴，女曰婢。故耕當問奴，織當問婢。今則奴為婦人之美稱，貴近之家其婦女則又自稱曰奴。"}],"source_pages":[101,102],"confidence":0.82,"boundary_state":"closed","continues_previous":false},{"kind":"heading","title":"閑事雜題","subtitle":"","author":"","form":"","heading_level":2,"series":null,"lines":[],"prose":"","notes":[],"source_pages":[102],"confidence":0.95,"boundary_state":"closed","continues_previous":false},{"kind":"poem","title":"","subtitle":"","author":"","form":"七言絕句","heading_level":null,"series":null,"lines":["閑翻繡譜與端相，","深纈葡萄淺睡香。","阿母慣嗔交頸鳥，","只描雙蝶過秋棠。"],"prose":"","notes":[{"position":{"field":"lines","line":2,"offset":4},"text":"漢書李廣利破大宛，得葡萄種歸漢。廬山記：一比丘晝寢盤石上，夢中聞花香酷烈，及覺求得之，因名睡香。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":3,"offset":7},"text":"本草：鴛鴦交頸而臥，其交不再。"}],"source_pages":[102],"confidence":0.9,"boundary_state":"closed","continues_previous":false},{"kind":"poem","title":"","subtitle":"","author":"","form":"七言絕句","heading_level":null,"series":null,"lines":["水沈薰徹藕絲衫，","寒映蝤蠐碧玉緘。","行出畫闌風曰好，","髻叢花片蝶飛銜。"],"prose":"","notes":[{"position":{"field":"lines","line":1,"offset":7},"text":"元稹詩：藕絲衫子柳花裙。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":2,"offset":4},"text":"詩：領如蝤蠐。"}],"source_pages":[102],"confidence":0.78,"boundary_state":"closed","continues_previous":false},{"kind":"poem","title":"","subtitle":"","author":"","form":"七言絕句","heading_level":null,"series":null,"lines":["掠鬢初齊側眼看，","紅棉新拭鏡光寒。","斜迴雪頸些些見，","貝齒留痕恰腦歡。"],"prose":"","notes":[{"position":{"field":"lines","line":2,"offset":2},"text":"韓偓詩：紅綿拭錦塵。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":3,"offset":7},"text":"舊唐書楊嗣復傳鄭覃曰：近日未免些些不公。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":4,"offset":2},"text":"史記東方朔傳：齒如編貝。後遺事：時帝齒痕猶在妾頸。"}],"source_pages":[102,103],"confidence":0.82,"boundary_state":"closed","continues_previous":false},{"kind":"poem","title":"","subtitle":"","author":"","form":"七言絕句","heading_level":null,"series":null,"lines":["拾得殘箋詩幾行，","瘦斜書勢似蕭郎。","莫教漏洩關心事，","貯向裙前瑟瑟囊。"],"prose":"","notes":[{"position":{"field":"lines","line":2,"offset":7},"text":"溫庭筠詩：門外蕭郎白馬嘶。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":3,"offset":4},"text":"一作箇中底。"}],"source_pages":[103],"confidence":0.86,"boundary_state":"closed","continues_previous":false},{"kind":"poem","title":"","subtitle":"","author":"","form":"七言絕句","heading_level":null,"series":null,"lines":["愛染朱絲約髻心，","退紅嫌淺絳嫌深。","通犀插久消光彩，","更遣尋求蜜蠟金。"],"prose":"","notes":[{"position":{"field":"lines","line":1,"offset":4},"text":"鮑照《白頭吟》：直如朱絲繩。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":3,"offset":2},"text":"漢書西域傳如淳注：通犀謂中央色白，通兩頭。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":4,"offset":7},"text":"唐書地理志：歸州巴東郡土貢蜜蠟。"}],"source_pages":[103],"confidence":0.86,"boundary_state":"closed","continues_previous":false},{"kind":"poem","title":"","subtitle":"","author":"","form":"七言絕句","heading_level":null,"series":null,"lines":["無端屑麝襯鞋池，","問道携來與阿誰。","笑殺冶城遊冶客，","平生不見十香詞。"],"prose":"","notes":[{"position":{"field":"lines","line":1,"offset":7},"text":"自注：南都有此。《南部煙花記》陳宮人臥履皆以薄玉花為飾，內散以龍腦諸香屑，謂之香塵。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":2,"offset":7},"text":"三國志龐統傳：向者之論，阿誰為失。"},{"position":{"field":"lines","line":3,"offset":4},"t